# PSR-5e3 — PLATFORM_TENANT_LIFECYCLE cluster

## Files (4)

| File | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| `start-platform-tenant-offboard.ts` | injectable `deps.prisma` kept |
| `cancel-platform-tenant-offboard.ts` | injectable kept |
| `purge-platform-tenant.ts` | injectable kept |
| `process-scheduled-tenant-deletions.ts` | direct client only |

Default path: `getPlatformAdminClient(PLATFORM_TENANT_LIFECYCLE)`.
Deps type uses `ReturnType<typeof getPlatformAdminClient>` (same PrismaClient).

## Non-goals

- Impersonation / provision / tenant-repo clusters
- Changing offboard retention or purge predicates

## Ratchet

`remaining_direct` → **19** (23 − 4).
